  "brain_first": "“情绪可以用表情、动作、身体反应和心理来写，不必只写情绪 词。”",
  "sort_order": 1066,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2673
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "需要表达 nervous, worried, relieved, grateful,",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2674
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "disappointed 等。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2675
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2676
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Showing emotion：用行为表现情绪。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2677
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “情绪可以用表情、动作、身体反应和心理来写，不必只写情绪",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2678
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "词。”",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2679
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 适量具体化能让续写更自然，但无需华丽。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2680
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2681
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先确定情绪方向。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2682
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 选一种表现方式：face / body / action / thought / speech。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2683
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 写1句即可，不要每句都描写。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2684
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 情绪必须由刚发生的事件触发。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2685
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2686
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2687
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2688
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· nervous → hands shaking / take a deep breath",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2689
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· relieved → shoulders relax / smile",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2690
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· grateful → thank / hold someone's hand / voice soften",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2691
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 情绪与事件原因清楚。",
      "sourcePage": 100,
      "sourceIndex": 2692
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不会高级句时用“simple action + simple feeling”即可。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2693
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2694
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For a moment I could not speak. Then I let out a long breath and smiled. 比 I was very relieved. 更具",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2695
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "体但仍简单。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2696
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2697
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 无原因突然大哭/大笑。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2698
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 每段连续堆五个身体反应。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2699
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2700
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 这个情绪从哪来？",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2701
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 表达是否自然不过度？",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2702
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2703
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2704
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2705
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 情绪用一个动作表现，比三个高级形容词更稳。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2706
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2708
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “I was very happy”可如何自然化？",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2709
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 情绪变化必须由什么触发？",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2710
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. hands were shaking 通常表达？",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2711
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. relieved前通常有什么？",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2712
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 情绪词越高级越好吗？",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2713
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 用表情/动作/身体反应/心理。；2. 事件/人物行动。；3. nervous/fear/excitement视语境。；4. 问题",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2714
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "缓解/危险解除。；5. 不是，正确自然优先。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2715
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— CW3 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“CW3”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2716
    }
  ],
